 "64321", "Batsman": "2630", "Commentary": "FOUR! Wow. We get to see a boundary. After that first ball six. A short ball, on middle, Samuels drags it through mid-wicket and finds the boundary.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.1", "Id": "41", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64321", "Batsman": "2630", "Commentary": "On a length around off, cutting back in, Samuels looks to flick but gets hit on the pads.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "40", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Faheem Ashraf is the new bowler. Another wicket on the cards?", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.6", "Id": "39", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64306", "Batsman": "65291", "Commentary": "Outside off, Powell looks to run it down to third man but gets a thick inside edge onto his pads. A WICKET MAIDEN for Hasan.", "Summary": {"Score": "15/4", "Over": "5", "Runs": "0", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "65291", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "0", "Balls": "5", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "2630", "Runs": "6", "Balls": "11", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "64306", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "1", "Runs": "0", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.5", "Id": "38", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64306", "Batsman": "65291", "Commentary": "The batsman defends it from within the crease.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Comment