 "Id": "27", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "7768", "Batsman": "2630", "Commentary": "Played to the mid-wicket region by the batsman. The fielder goes for a direct hit but misses the stumps.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.1", "Id": "26", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "7768", "Batsman": "2630", "Commentary": "WIDE. Full and well outside off, angling away, Samuels lets it go.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.6", "Id": "25", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57935", "Batsman": "3696", "Commentary": "Defended off the front foot by the batsman presenting the full face of the bat.", "Summary": {"Score": "14/3", "Over": "3", "Runs": "6", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "3696", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "0", "Balls": "4", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "2630", "Runs": "6", "Balls": "5", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "57935", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "12", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.6", "Id": "24", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57935", "Batsman": "3696", "Commentary": "WIDE. Down the leg side, flick shot missed.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.5", "Id": "23", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57935", "Batsman": "3696", "Commentary": "Full on middle, driven straight back.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.4", "Id": "22", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57935", "Batsman": "3696", "Commentary": "Full and outside off, driven back to the bowler.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.3", "Id": "21", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "6,267,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57935", "Batsman": "2630", "Commentary": "The batsman has driven that ball straight back. They pick up a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.2", "Id": "20", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "4,164,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57935", "Batsman": "2630", "Commentary": "FOUR! Lucky! Landed outside off, Samuels looks to flick but gets a leading edge which balloons over covers and speeds away to the boundary!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.1", "Id": "19", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57935", "Batsman": "2630", "Commentary": "Full and around off, pushed back to the bowler.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.6", "Id": "18", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "7768", "Batsman": "3696", "Commentary": "The batsman has punched the ball off the back foot. Scintillating over.", "Summary": {"Score": "8/3", "Over": "2", "Runs": "2", "Wickets": "2", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "3696", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "0", "Balls": "1", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "2630", "Runs": "1", "Balls": "2", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "7768", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "2", "Wickets": "2"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "17", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Denesh Ramdin walks in now, at number 5, replacing his captain.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.5", "Id": "16", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "7768", "Batsman": "11705", "Commentary": "OUT! Ctrl plus c 1.3, ctrl plus v 1.5. Jargon? Well, not exactly. It is an exact carbon copy of the Fletcher dismissal, so much so that I am getting tempted to do a copy and paste of that ball. Everything is nearly the same in both balls. The length, the line - outside off, angling away, the batsman playing a loose poke, aerially through the covers and finding Hussain Talat to perfection at cover-point. A 2-ball duck for the 3-match skipper.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "11705", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.4", "Id": "15", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "7768", "Batsman": "11705", "Commentary": "The batsman gets a bottom edge of the bat on that one.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "14", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Skipper comes in now. Jason Mohammed.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.3", "Id": "13", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "7768", "Batsman": "4915", "Commentary": "OUT! Straight to the man! A length ball outside off again, Fletcher tamely pushes it through the line but hits it straight to Hussain Talat at cover-point! Soft, soft dismissal. You either go hard and over the top or play soft strokes along the ground. Nothing mid-way.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "4915", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.2", "Id": "12", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "3,124,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "7768", "Batsman": "2630", "Commentary": "A length ball outside off, Samuels slashes hard and gets a thick outside edge. The ball nearly goes all the way to third man. A single taken.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.1", "Id": "11", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "7768", "Batsman": "2630", "Commentary": "Outside off, chipped aerially towards mid off.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.1", "Id": "10", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "7768", "Batsman": "2630", "Commentary": "WIDE. Full and wide outside off, Samuels goes hard at that but misses.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "9", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Mohammad Amir to share the attack with Nawaz.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.6", "Id": "8", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57935", "Batsman": "4915", "Commentary": "The batsman has defended it by getting right behind the line of the delivery.  What an over - 6, 0, 0, W, 0, 0 - Brilliant!", "Summary": {"Score": "6/1", "Over": "1", "Runs": "6", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "4915", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "0", "Balls": "2", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "2630", "Runs": "0", "Balls": "0", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "57935", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "6", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.5", "Id": "7", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57935", "Batsman": "4915", "Commentary": "Full and straight, pushed back to the bowler.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "6", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Marlon Samuels walks in at number 3, replacing Walton.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.4", "Id": "5", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57935", "Batsman": "7861", "Commentary": "OUT! He is gone now. Nawaz has the last laugh. If you concede a six and then pick a wicket, not a bad deal, eh? Tossed up outside off, Walton comes down the track and looks to go over the top but is not quite to the pitch of the ball. Miscues it towards long off and Asif Ali gets a simple catch. A 6 on the first ball, followed by 3 dots...", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "7861", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.3", "Id": "4", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57935", "Batsman": "7861", "Commentary": "The batsman shows the full face of the bat and defends the ball off the back foot.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.2", "Id": "3", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57935", "Batsman": "7861", "Commentary": "A quicker ball, Chadwick looks to flick but misses and is hit on the pads.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.1", "Id": "2", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "1,28,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57935", "Batsman": "7861", "Commentary": "SIX! TAKE THAT! What a start to the run chase. Short and flat, on middle, Walton goes back and pulls it over square leg!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "1", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "They are already back. Andre Fletcher and Chadwick Walton will open the batting while Mohammad Nawaz will start off with spin. Walton to face.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}], "Deleted_UID": null}, "meta": {"app_status_code": 1, "message": "Success", "pagination": true, "count": 113, "timestamp": {"utc_time": "6/20/2026 7:14:40 AM"}}}